{"version":1,"content":"<p>女星張栢芝前晚現身上海，擔任台灣歌手袁詠琳演唱會的表演嘉賓。</p><p>二人的情誼始於綜藝節目《乘風破浪的姐姐》，雖然是不同季度加盟，但在一次幫唱環節中同台演出，結下不解之緣。</p><p>栢芝與袁詠琳在台上演繹新歌《I'm a woman》，動感十足，為演唱會掀起</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T16:24:51.159164+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T16:01:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T16:17:31.126715+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T16:17:31.126715+00:00","content_hash":"3d3b4e171148baaf04f1f8af0d537fa41ec88f6c241c1710048a0fc3377a9960","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}